  "html": "<section class=\"data-management\" data-storage-view=\"overview\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"data-management-title\"><header class=\"data-management-header\"><h2 id=\"data-management-title\">数据管理</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"data-refresh\" aria-label=\"刷新数据管理\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-cw\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\"></path><path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16\"></path><path d=\"M8 16H3v5\"></path></svg><span>刷新</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"data-close\" aria-label=\"关闭数据管理\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></button></header><div class=\"data-management-scroll\"><div class=\"data-error\" role=\"alert\">Controlled inventory failure<button type=\"button\">重试读取</button></div><section class=\"data-backup-section\" aria-label=\"本地备份\"><h3>本地备份</h3><div class=\"data-backup-actions\"><button type=\"button\">导入备份…</button><button type=\"button\">导出完整备份…</button></div><p class=\"data-explanation\">包含已保存的备忘录、文件夹、设置和全部登记附件原文件，其他窗口未提交的草稿不在备份中。合并导入，冲突保留为副本，并应用备份设置。</p></section></div></section>",
